# Generated from the OSRS Wiki page "Transcript:The Heart of Darkness/Journal" by tools/quests/journals_from_wiki.py; set a step's stage to pin it.
before	<col=000080>I can start this quest by talking to <col=800000>Prince Itzla Arkan</col> in the <col=800000>Teomat</col> atop <col=800000>Ralos' Rise</col>.</col>
step	1	-	Discussing the queen's visit
line	<col=000080>I spoke to <col=800000>Prince Itzla Arkan</col> in the <col=800000>Teomat</col> atop <col=800000>Ralos' Rise</col>. He told me he had a plan for dealing with the <col=800000>Twilight Emissaries</col>. However, while explaining it to me, his mother, <col=800000>Queen Zyanyi Arkan</col>, arrived and admonished him for failing to stop the attack on the <col=800000>Teomat</col>. I should discuss this with <col=800000>Itzla</col>.</col>
step	2	-	Renting the room
line	<col=000080>I spoke to <col=800000>Prince Itzla Arkan</col> in the <col=800000>Teomat</col> atop <col=800000>Ralos' Rise</col>. He told me he had a plan for dealing with the <col=800000>Twilight Emissaries</col>. However, while explaining it to me, his mother, <col=800000>Queen Zyanyi Arkan</col>, arrived and admonished him for failing to stop the attack on the <col=800000>Teomat</col>. <col=800000>Itzla</col> then directed me to rent the <col=800000>Basement Room</col> in the <col=800000>Quetzacalli Gorge Pub</col>. A <col=800000>Contact</col> of his will meet me there.</col>
step	3	-	Meeting the contact
line	<str>I spoke to Prince Itzla Arkan in the Teomat atop Ralos' Rise. He told me he had a plan for dealing with the Twilight Emissaries. However, while explaining it to me, his mother, Queen Zyanyi Arkan, arrived and admonished him for failing to stop the attack on the Teomat. Itzla then directed me to rent the Basement Room in the Quetzacalli Gorge Pub.</str>
line	<col=000080>I travelled to the <col=800000>Quetzacalli Gorge Pub</col> and rented a room there. I should wait in the room for <col=800000>Itzla's Contact</col> to arrive.</col>
step	4	-	After resting in the bed
line	<str>I spoke to Prince Itzla Arkan in the Teomat atop Ralos' Rise. He told me he had a plan for dealing with the Twilight Emissaries. However, while explaining it to me, his mother, Queen Zyanyi Arkan, arrived and admonished him for failing to stop the attack on the Teomat. Itzla then directed me to rent the Basement Room in the Quetzacalli Gorge Pub.</str>
line	<col=000080>I travelled to the <col=800000>Quetzacalli Gorge Pub</col> and rented a room there. I should meet with <col=800000>Itzla's Contact</col> in the room.</col>
step	5	-	Speaking to the shopkeeper
line	<str>I spoke to Prince Itzla Arkan in the Teomat atop Ralos' Rise. He told me he had a plan for dealing with the Twilight Emissaries. However, while explaining it to me, his mother, Queen Zyanyi Arkan, arrived and admonished him for failing to stop the attack on the Teomat. Itzla then directed me to rent the Basement Room in the Quetzacalli Gorge Pub.</str>
line	<col=000080>I travelled to the <col=800000>Quetzacalli Gorge Pub</col> and rented a room there. I met with <col=800000>Itzla's Contact</col>, but they turned out to be <col=800000>Itzla</col> himself. He explained that his plan is for us to infiltrate the <col=800000>Twilight Emissaries</col> by posing as new recruits. He then told me that the <col=800000>Quetzacalli Gorge Shopkeeper</col> is believed to be a member of the <col=800000>Emissaries</col>. As such, I should speak to him about joining.</col>
step	6	-	Reporting to Itzla
line	<str>I spoke to Prince Itzla Arkan in the Teomat atop Ralos' Rise. He told me he had a plan for dealing with the Twilight Emissaries. However, while explaining it to me, his mother, Queen Zyanyi Arkan, arrived and admonished him for failing to stop the attack on the Teomat. Itzla then directed me to rent the Basement Room in the Quetzacalli Gorge Pub.</str>
line	<col=000080>I travelled to the <col=800000>Quetzacalli Gorge Pub</col> and rented a room there. I met with <col=800000>Itzla's Contact</col>, but they turned out to be <col=800000>Itzla</col> himself. He explained that his plan is for us to infiltrate the <col=800000>Twilight Emissaries</col> by posing as new recruits. He then told me that the <col=800000>Quetzacalli Gorge Shopkeeper</col> is believed to be a member of the <col=800000>Emissaries</col>. As such, I spoke to him about joining and he agreed to send word to the <col=800000>Emissaries</col>. I should let <col=800000>Itzla</col> know.</col>
step	7	-	Meeting the Emissaries
line	<str>I spoke to Prince Itzla Arkan in the Teomat atop Ralos' Rise. He told me he had a plan for dealing with the Twilight Emissaries. However, while explaining it to me, his mother, Queen Zyanyi Arkan, arrived and admonished him for failing to stop the attack on the Teomat. Itzla then directed me to rent the Basement Room in the Quetzacalli Gorge Pub.</str>
line	<str>I travelled to the Quetzacalli Gorge Pub and rented a room there. I met with Itzla's Contact, but they turned out to be Itzla himself. He explained that his plan is for us to infiltrate the Twilight Emissaries by posing as new recruits. To do so, I spoke to the Quetzacalli Gorge Shopkeeper, a member of the Emissaries, about joining. He agreed to send word to them.</str>
line	<col=000080>I returned <col=800000>Itzla</col> and let him know that the <col=800000>Shopkeeper</col> agreed to contact the <col=800000>Emissaries</col> for us. <col=800000>Itzla</col> then asked me to meet him at the <col=800000>Twilight Temple</col> where the <col=800000>Emissaries</col> are based. I can find the <col=800000>Temple</col> east of <col=800000>Quetzacalli Gorge</col>.</col>
step	8	-	Talking to the recruits
line	<str>I spoke to Prince Itzla Arkan in the Teomat atop Ralos' Rise. He told me he had a plan for dealing with the Twilight Emissaries. However, while explaining it to me, his mother, Queen Zyanyi Arkan, arrived and admonished him for failing to stop the attack on the Teomat. Itzla then directed me to rent the Basement Room in the Quetzacalli Gorge Pub.</str>
line	<str>I travelled to the Quetzacalli Gorge Pub and rented a room there. I met with Itzla's Contact, but they turned out to be Itzla himself. He explained that his plan is for us to infiltrate the Twilight Emissaries by posing as new recruits. To do so, I spoke to the Quetzacalli Gorge Shopkeeper, a member of the Emissaries, about joining. He agreed to send word to them. I returned to Itzla and let him know that the Shopkeeper agreed to contact the Emissaries for us. Itzla then asked me to meet him at the Twilight Temple where the Emissaries are based.</str>
line	<col=000080>I travelled to the <col=800000>Twilight Temple</col> east of <col=800000>Quetzacalli Gorge</col> and met with <col=800000>Itzla</col> outside the <col=800000>Tower of Ascension</col>. While we wait to be called up to take our <col=800000>Recruitment Tests</col>, <col=800000>Itzla</col> suggested I speak to the other <col=800000>Recruits</col>.</col>
step	9	-	Discussing the Augur
line	<str>I spoke to Prince Itzla Arkan in the Teomat atop Ralos' Rise. He told me he had a plan for dealing with the Twilight Emissaries. However, while explaining it to me, his mother, Queen Zyanyi Arkan, arrived and admonished him for failing to stop the attack on the Teomat. Itzla then directed me to rent the Basement Room in the Quetzacalli Gorge Pub.</str>
line	<str>I travelled to the Quetzacalli Gorge Pub and rented a room there. I met with Itzla's Contact, but they turned out to be Itzla himself. He explained that his plan is for us to infiltrate the Twilight Emissaries by posing as new recruits. To do so, I spoke to the Quetzacalli Gorge Shopkeeper, a member of the Emissaries, about joining. He agreed to send word to them. I returned to Itzla and let him know that the Shopkeeper agreed to contact the Emissaries for us. Itzla then asked me to meet him at the Twilight Temple where the Emissaries are based.</str>
line	<col=000080>I travelled to the <col=800000>Twilight Temple</col> east of <col=800000>Quetzacalli Gorge</col> and met with <col=800000>Itzla</col> outside the <col=800000>Tower of Ascension</col>. While we waited to be called up to take our <col=800000>Recruitment Tests</col>, I spoke with the other <col=800000>Recruits</col>. One of them told me the <col=800000>Emissaries</col> had a new leader called the <col=800000>Augur</col>. I should discuss this with <col=800000>Itzla</col>.</col>
step	10	-	Heading into the tests
line	<str>I spoke to Prince Itzla Arkan in the Teomat atop Ralos' Rise. He told me he had a plan for dealing with the Twilight Emissaries. However, while explaining it to me, his mother, Queen Zyanyi Arkan, arrived and admonished him for failing to stop the attack on the Teomat. Itzla then directed me to rent the Basement Room in the Quetzacalli Gorge Pub.</str>
line	<str>I travelled to the Quetzacalli Gorge Pub and rented a room there. I met with Itzla's Contact, but they turned out to be Itzla himself. He explained that his plan is for us to infiltrate the Twilight Emissaries by posing as new recruits. To do so, I spoke to the Quetzacalli Gorge Shopkeeper, a member of the Emissaries, about joining. He agreed to send word to them. I returned to Itzla and let him know that the Shopkeeper agreed to contact the Emissaries for us. Itzla then asked me to meet him at the Twilight Temple where the Emissaries are based.</str>
line	<str>I travelled to the Twilight Temple east of Quetzacalli Gorge and met with Itzla outside of the Tower of Ascension. While we waited to be called up to take our Recruitment Tests, I spoke to the other Recruits. One of them told me the Emissaries had a new leader called the Augur.</str>
line	<col=000080><col=800000>Itzla</col> and I were called into the <col=800000>Tower of Ascension</col> by <col=800000>Forebearer Janus</col>. We should head inside and speak to him.</col>
