line	<col=000080><col=800000>Itzla</col> and I attended our <col=800000>Initiation Ceremony</col> in the <col=800000>Temple</col>. There, we discovered the <col=800000>Augur</col> to be <col=800000>Metzli</col>. Not only that, but <col=800000>Metzli</col> revealed <col=800000>Ennuis</col> and <col=800000>Furia</col> to be part of the <col=800000>Emissaries</col> as well, with her claiming them to be <col=800000>Ralos</col> and <col=800000>Ranul</col> reborn. I should discuss this with <col=800000>Itzla</col>.</col>
