line	<col=000080><col=800000>Itzla</col> and I attended our <col=800000>Initiation Ceremony</col> in the <col=800000>Temple</col>. There, we discovered the <col=800000>Augur</col> to be <col=800000>Metzli</col>. Not only that, but <col=800000>Metzli</col> revealed <col=800000>Ennuis</col> and <col=800000>Furia</col> to be part of the <col=800000>Emissaries</col> as well, with her claiming them to be <col=800000>Ralos</col> and <col=800000>Ranul</col> reborn. I discussed this with <col=800000>Itzla</col> and he suggested we continue to investigate the <col=800000>Emissaries</col> to find out more about their plans. To do so, we should talk to <col=800000>Forebearer Fides</col> in the <col=800000>Temple</col> about our first duties.</col>
step	19	-	Entering the ruins
line	<str>I spoke to Prince Itzla Arkan in the Teomat atop Ralos' Rise. He told me he had a plan for dealing with the Twilight Emissaries. However, while explaining it to me, his mother, Queen Zyanyi Arkan, arrived and admonished him for failing to stop the attack on the Teomat. Itzla then directed me to rent the Basement Room in the Quetzacalli Gorge Pub.</str>
