line	<str>Itzla and I attended our Initiation Ceremony in the Temple. There, we discovered the Augur to be Metzli. Not only that, but Metzli revealed Ennuis and Furia to be part of the Emissaries as well, with her claiming them to be Ralos and Ranul reborn. I discussed this with Itzla and he suggested we continue to investigate the Emissaries to find out more about their plans.</str>
line	<col=000080><col=800000>Itzla</col> and I spoke to <col=800000>Forebearer Fides</col> in the <col=800000>Temple</col> about our first duties. She tasked us with helping to clear a path into some <col=800000>Old One Ruins</col> known as <col=800000>Tapoyauik</col> beneath the <col=800000>Temple</col>. We should head down into the <col=800000>Ruins</col> when we're ready.</col>
