line	<str>I travelled to the Quetzacalli Gorge Pub and rented a room there. I met with Itzla's Contact, but they turned out to be Itzla himself. He explained that his plan is for us to infiltrate the Twilight Emissaries by posing as new recruits. To do so, I spoke to the Quetzacalli Gorge Shopkeeper, a member of the Emissaries, about joining. He agreed to send word to them. I returned to Itzla and let him know that the Shopkeeper agreed to contact the Emissaries for us. Itzla then asked me to meet him at the Twilight Temple where the Emissaries are based.</str>
line	<str>I travelled to the Twilight Temple east of Quetzacalli Gorge and met with Itzla outside of the Tower of Ascension. While we waited to be called up to take our Recruitment Tests, I spoke to the other Recruits. One of them told me the Emissaries had a new leader called the Augur.</str>
line	<str>Itzla and I were called into the Tower of Ascension by Forebearer Janus. He tasked us with overcoming four Trials within the Tower, which we were successful in doing so. He then invited us to attend an Initiation Ceremony in the Temple.</str>
line	<str>Itzla and I attended our Initiation Ceremony in the Temple. There, we discovered the Augur to be Metzli. Not only that, but Metzli revealed Ennuis and Furia to be part of the Emissaries as well, with her claiming them to be Ralos and Ranul reborn. I discussed this with Itzla and he suggested we continue to investigate the Emissaries to find out more about their plans.</str>
line	<col=000080><col=800000>Itzla</col> and I spoke to <col=800000>Forebearer Fides</col> in the <col=800000>Temple</col> about our first duties. She tasked us with helping to clear a path into some <col=800000>Old One Ruins</col> known as <col=800000>Tapoyauik</col> beneath the <col=800000>Temple</col>. To do so, I'll need to help mine through a <col=800000>Blockage</col> in the <col=800000>Ruins</col>.</col>
step	21	-	Reuniting with Itzla
line	<str>I spoke to Prince Itzla Arkan in the Teomat atop Ralos' Rise. He told me he had a plan for dealing with the Twilight Emissaries. However, while explaining it to me, his mother, Queen Zyanyi Arkan, arrived and admonished him for failing to stop the attack on the Teomat. Itzla then directed me to rent the Basement Room in the Quetzacalli Gorge Pub.</str>
line	<str>I travelled to the Quetzacalli Gorge Pub and rented a room there. I met with Itzla's Contact, but they turned out to be Itzla himself. He explained that his plan is for us to infiltrate the Twilight Emissaries by posing as new recruits. To do so, I spoke to the Quetzacalli Gorge Shopkeeper, a member of the Emissaries, about joining. He agreed to send word to them. I returned to Itzla and let him know that the Shopkeeper agreed to contact the Emissaries for us. Itzla then asked me to meet him at the Twilight Temple where the Emissaries are based.</str>
line	<str>I travelled to the Twilight Temple east of Quetzacalli Gorge and met with Itzla outside of the Tower of Ascension. While we waited to be called up to take our Recruitment Tests, I spoke to the other Recruits. One of them told me the Emissaries had a new leader called the Augur.</str>
line	<str>Itzla and I were called into the Tower of Ascension by Forebearer Janus. He tasked us with overcoming four Trials within the Tower, which we were successful in doing so. He then invited us to attend an Initiation Ceremony in the Temple.</str>
line	<str>Itzla and I attended our Initiation Ceremony in the Temple. There, we discovered the Augur to be Metzli. Not only that, but Metzli revealed Ennuis and Furia to be part of the Emissaries as well, with her claiming them to be Ralos and Ranul reborn. I discussed this with Itzla and he suggested we continue to investigate the Emissaries to find out more about their plans.</str>
line	<str>Itzla and I spoke to Forebearer Fides in the Temple about our first duties. She tasked us with helping to clear a path into some Old One Ruins known as Tapoyauik beneath the Temple.</str>
line	<col=000080>I helped mine through a <col=800000>Blockage</col> in the <col=800000>Ruins</col>. However, some <col=800000>Nagua</col> ambushed us on the other side, separating myself and <col=800000>Itzla</col>. I'll need to progress through the <col=800000>Ruins</col> on my own and meet up with <col=800000>Itzla</col> further ahead.</col>
step	22	-	Amoxliatl
line	<str>I spoke to Prince Itzla Arkan in the Teomat atop Ralos' Rise. He told me he had a plan for dealing with the Twilight Emissaries. However, while explaining it to me, his mother, Queen Zyanyi Arkan, arrived and admonished him for failing to stop the attack on the Teomat. Itzla then directed me to rent the Basement Room in the Quetzacalli Gorge Pub.</str>
