done	<str>I fought Amoxliatl off until she teleported me out of the Ruins. I then travelled to the Sunrise Palace in Civitas illa Fortis where I encountered Servius. He prepared to pass the news on to the Queen and assured me I'd be involved in the plan to rescue Itzla.</str>
